{"_id":"PbSEh8hhpsxJOvOY","folder":null,"img":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/pathfinder-npc-core/watchmage.webp","items":[{"_id":"29shlbNACAjnJLD9","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","name":"Arcane Prepared Spells","sort":100000,"system":{"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"description":{"value":""},"prepared":{"flexible":false,"value":"prepared"},"proficiency":{"value":1},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"slots":{"slot0":{"max":5,"prepared":[{"id":"aiuPhWT0qND0NtnV"},{"id":"u5ARLhCnGfIaISnf"},{"id":"Y61Q4es6ITruXLHB"},{"id":"Z3G89kbEiyEFAt81"},{"id":"dsbhZQrQQn1EyuUL"}]},"slot1":{"max":3,"prepared":[{"id":"WrXH7Upj6kFyvs4G"},{"id":"iv7tk7yyoeyni5vj"},{"id":"mPcd3CkCyxGyH7Kl"}]},"slot2":{"max":2,"prepared":[{"id":"xPkHCIIX1yoOqt3D"},{"id":"hp1orl8mGWI5abqE"}]},"slot3":{"max":2,"prepared":[{"id":"c9AuAbimxx6aVpdR"},{"id":"C1gFOddSKcNP3KJT"}]}},"slug":null,"spelldc":{"dc":20,"value":12},"tradition":{"value":"arcane"},"traits":{},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spellcastingEntry","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!PbSEh8hhpsxJOvOY.29shlbNACAjnJLD9"},{"_id":"c9AuAbimxx6aVpdR","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.o6YCGx4lycsYpww4"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/haste.webp","name":"Haste","sort":200000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Magic empowers the target to act faster. It gains the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened} condition and can use the extra action each round only for Strike and Stride actions.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> You can target up to 6 creatures.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.ElkXovNrHB0Doi6O]{Spell Effect: Haste}</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"1 minute"},"heightening":{"levels":{"7":{"target":{"value":"6 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"},"level":{"value":3},"location":{"value":"29shlbNACAjnJLD9"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"haste","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!PbSEh8hhpsxJOvOY.c9AuAbimxx6aVpdR"},{"_id":"C1gFOddSKcNP3KJT","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.WsUwpfmhKrKwoIe3"},"img":"icons/magic/time/hourglass-tilted-gray.webp","name":"Slow","sort":300000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You dilate the flow of time around the target, slowing its actions.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"1 minute"},"heightening":{"levels":{"6":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"},"level":{"value":3},"location":{"value":"29shlbNACAjnJLD9"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"slow","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!PbSEh8hhpsxJOvOY.C1gFOddSKcNP3KJT"},{"_id":"xPkHCIIX1yoOqt3D","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/dispel-magic.webp","name":"Dispel Magic","sort":400000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":true,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You unravel the magic behind a spell or effect. Attempt a counteract check against the target. If you successfully counteract a magic item, the item becomes a mundane item of its type for 10 minutes. This doesn't change the item's non-magical properties. If the target is an artifact or similar item, you automatically fail.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"value":"29shlbNACAjnJLD9"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"dispel-magic","target":{"value":"1 spell effect or unattended magic item"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!PbSEh8hhpsxJOvOY.xPkHCIIX1yoOqt3D"},{"_id":"hp1orl8mGWI5abqE","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.jwK43yKsHTkJQvQ9"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/see-invisibility.webp","name":"See the Unseen","sort":500000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Your gaze pierces through illusions and finds @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible} creatures and spirits. You can see invisible creatures as though they weren't invisible, although their features are blurred, making them @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} and difficult to identify. You can also see incorporeal creatures, like ghosts, phased through an object from within 10 feet of an object's surface as blurry shapes seen through those objects. Subtler clues also grant you a +2 status bonus to checks you make to disbelieve illusions.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> This spell has a duration of 8 hours.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.T5bk6UH7yuYog1Fp]{Spell Effect: See the Unseen}</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"10 minutes"},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"value":"29shlbNACAjnJLD9"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":""},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"see-the-unseen","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","revelation"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!PbSEh8hhpsxJOvOY.hp1orl8mGWI5abqE"},{"_id":"WrXH7Upj6kFyvs4G","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.aIHY2DArKFweIrpf"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/command.webp","name":"Command","sort":600000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"description":{"value":"<p>You shout a command that's hard to ignore. You can command the target to approach you, run away (as if it had the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} condition), release what it's holding, drop @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}, or stand in place. It can't @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.A72nHGUtNXgY5Ey9]{Delay} or take any reactions until it has obeyed your command. The effects depend on the target's Will save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> For the first action on its next turn, the creature must use a single action to do as you command.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target must use all its actions on its next turn to obey your command.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> You can target up to 10 creatures.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"until the end of the target's next turn"},"heightening":{"levels":{"5":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}},"type":"fixed"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"29shlbNACAjnJLD9"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"command","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"value":["auditory","concentrate","linguistic","manipulate","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!PbSEh8hhpsxJOvOY.WrXH7Upj6kFyvs4G"},{"_id":"aiuPhWT0qND0NtnV","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gpzpAAAJ1Lza2JVl"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/detect-magic.webp","name":"Detect Magic","sort":700000,"system":{"area":{"type":"emanation","value":30},"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies. You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower rank than the rank of your <em>detect magic</em> spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bikFUFRLwfdvX2x2]{Invisibility Potion}) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the rank or level of the most powerful magical effect the spell detects, as determined by the GM.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd rank, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-rank magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"29shlbNACAjnJLD9"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":""},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"detect-magic","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","detection","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!PbSEh8hhpsxJOvOY.aiuPhWT0qND0NtnV"},{"_id":"iv7tk7yyoeyni5vj","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gKKqvLohtrSJj3BM"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/magic-missile.webp","name":"Force Barrage","sort":800000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"1d4+1","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"force"}},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You fire a shard of solidified magic toward a creature that you can see. It automatically hits and deals 1d4+1 force damage. For each additional action you use when Casting the Spell, increase the number of shards you shoot by one, to a maximum of three shards for 3 actions. You choose the target for each shard individually. If you shoot more than one shard at the same target, combine the damage before applying bonuses or penalties to damage, resistances, weaknesses, and so forth.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> You fire one additional shard with each action you spend.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"29shlbNACAjnJLD9"},"overlays":{},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"force-barrage","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"1 to 3"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"],"value":["concentrate","force","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!PbSEh8hhpsxJOvOY.iv7tk7yyoeyni5vj"},{"_id":"u5ARLhCnGfIaISnf","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.IxhGEKl63R4QBvkj"},"img":"icons/magic/movement/trail-streak-impact-blue.webp","name":"Frostbite","sort":900000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"3bsJUDEgedKhPx6T":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"2d4","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"cold"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"fortitude"}},"description":{"value":"<p>An orb of biting cold coalesces around your target, freezing its body. The target takes 2d4 cold damage with a basic Fortitude save. On a critical failure, the target also gains weakness 1 to bludgeoning until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.DdqWMj7cuf4S1bgr]{Spell Effect: Frostbite}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4 and the weakness on a critical failure increases by 1.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"damage":{"3bsJUDEgedKhPx6T":"1d4"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"29shlbNACAjnJLD9"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"frostbite","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"],"value":["cantrip","cold","concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!PbSEh8hhpsxJOvOY.u5ARLhCnGfIaISnf"},{"_id":"Y61Q4es6ITruXLHB","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.6DfLZBl8wKIV03Iq"},"img":"icons/magic/fire/explosion-embers-evade-silhouette.webp","name":"Ignition","sort":1000000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"cQDyW0QpjJ38MlSi":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"2d4","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"fire"}},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You snap your fingers and point at a target, which begins to smolder. Make a spell attack roll against the target's AC, dealing 2d4 fire damage on a hit. If the target is within your melee reach, you can choose to make a melee spell attack with the flame instead of a ranged spell attack, which increases all the spell's damage dice to d6s.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double damage and 1d4 persistent fire damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The initial damage increases by 1d4 and the persistent fire damage on a critical hit increases by 1d4.</p>\n<p>@Damage[(@item.rank)d4[persistent,fire]]{Scaling Persistent Fire Damage}</p>\n<p>@Damage[(@item.rank)d6[persistent,fire]]{Scaling Persistent Fire Damage (Melee)}</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"damage":{"cQDyW0QpjJ38MlSi":"1d4"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"29shlbNACAjnJLD9"},"overlays":{"eOCNn2ohYAvsYZjn":{"_id":"eOCNn2ohYAvsYZjn","overlayType":"override","sort":1,"system":{}},"xYyA7CV1GaFTRjBQ":{"_id":"xYyA7CV1GaFTRjBQ","name":"Ignition (Melee)","overlayType":"override","sort":2,"system":{"damage":{"cQDyW0QpjJ38MlSi":{"formula":"2d6"}},"heightening":{"damage":{"cQDyW0QpjJ38MlSi":"1d6"}},"range":{"value":"touch"}}}},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"ignition","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"],"value":["attack","cantrip","concentrate","fire","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!PbSEh8hhpsxJOvOY.Y61Q4es6ITruXLHB"},{"_id":"Z3G89kbEiyEFAt81","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.OhD2Z6rIGGD5ocZA"},"img":"icons/magic/light/explosion-star-glow-silhouette.webp","name":"Read Aura","sort":1100000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You focus on the target object, opening your mind to perceive magical auras. When the casting is complete, you know whether that item is magical. You or anyone you advise about the aura gains a +2 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.eReSHVEPCsdkSL4G]{Identify Magic} on the item. If the object is illusory, you detect this only if the effect's rank is lower than the rank of your <em>read aura</em> spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to 10 objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target any number of objects.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"10 objects"}},"6":{"target":{"value":"any number of objects"}}},"type":"fixed"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"29shlbNACAjnJLD9"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"read-aura","target":{"value":"1 object"},"time":{"value":"1 minute"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","detection","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!PbSEh8hhpsxJOvOY.Z3G89kbEiyEFAt81"},{"_id":"mPcd3CkCyxGyH7Kl","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Gb7SeieEvd0pL2Eh"},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-blade-scimitar-gray-red.webp","name":"Sure Strike","sort":1200000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>The next time you make an attack roll before the end of your turn, roll it twice and use the better result. The attack ignores circumstance penalties to the attack roll and any flat check required due to the target being @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden}. You are then temporarily immune to <em>sure strike</em> for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.fpGDAz2v5PG0zUSl]{Spell Effect: Sure Strike}</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"until the end of your turn"},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"29shlbNACAjnJLD9"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":""},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"sure-strike","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"1"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"],"value":["concentrate","fortune"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!PbSEh8hhpsxJOvOY.mPcd3CkCyxGyH7Kl"},{"_id":"dsbhZQrQQn1EyuUL","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.uZK2BYzPnxUBnDjr"},"img":"icons/magic/nature/root-vine-entangled-hand.webp","name":"Tangle Vine","sort":1300000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>A vine appears from thin air, flicking from your hand and lashing itself to the target. Attempt a spell attack roll against the target.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.TwtUIEyenrtAbeiX]{Spell Effect: Tangle Vine}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target gains the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} condition and takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape} against your spell DC to remove the penalty and the immobilized condition.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to Escape against your spell DC to remove the penalty.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The effects last for 2 rounds.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The effects last for 1 minute.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":""},"level":{"value":1},"location":{"value":"29shlbNACAjnJLD9"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"tangle-vine","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane",